/*
  VehicleGauges.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0304 · VehicleGauges (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleGauges` resolves (table "VehicleGauges") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/VehicleGauges.tsx). The second group backs the
  native chrome (loading / empty / error / freshness), the model silhouette
  captions, and the car-visualization VoiceOver, so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals. `common.notAvailable` localizes the web `|| 'N/A'` software
  fallback (a literal in the source) rather than hardcoding it.
*/

